#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A frozen, line-numbered draft went out for public review. This is what happens to ONE comment that comes back: placed on the block it cites, triaged, weighed by the review committee, decided by the editor and, if the decision changes the document, made on a feature branch whose staging preview shows the text before and after. The change set is reviewed by the same process as any content change (Process_ContentChangeReview); only the intake is new. Skill: public-comment."
msgstr ""

