#. Diagram label
msgid "Review committee"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:56
#. Diagram label
msgid "Review coordinator"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:160
#. Diagram label
msgid "Review the change set on its staging preview"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:161
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The existing content-change review, unchanged, of the author's branch: its PR lists the PC refs it answers, and its staging preview is the after side of every deep link. A change the reviewers send back returns to the author inside that process."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:71
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The one lane that decides. Every decision carries one of five codes and, for every code but accepted, a reason the commenter is owed. A decision that does not change the document ends here."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:193
#. Diagram label
msgid "to be weighed"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:100
#. Diagram label
msgid "Triage: confirm the anchor, type and priority"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:51
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Turns each returned row, form response or cited passage into one comment and resolves its anchor through the review version's page/line map. A citation that resolves to nothing is kept as unplaced, never dropped."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:83
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Where the author's edit is reviewed and lands: the feature branch's staging preview gives before/after deep links to each comment's anchor, the change set is reviewed as any content change, and each comment it answers is marked incorporated when it merges."
msgstr ""

